        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks to the swift response and teamwork of the Chernobog Military Police...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "...the situation is largely under control. The incidents in most areas have already been contained.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "Currently, the Military Police has already surrounded the thugs who had taken Vaschuk Prospect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you can see, this senseless violence is about to be put to an end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please do not panic. Stay indoors, and await another victory for Chernobog...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "May the glory of Ursus bless the Emperor and his people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "TV Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cher_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Curse them... where the hell did they get those kinds of equipment and weapons?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get scared! Cowards in armor are still just cowards! They're just a bunch of untrained thugs!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... there are so many of them...! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've already taken out forces three times the size of ours! Just do it again, and the battle will be over!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough with the nonsense, Chernobog scum!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You filth think you can stand against us? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exile and hard labor are too good for your kind. We should have executed the lot of you the moment you were captured!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "How dare you...! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...! They're rushing us again. Our front lines won't hold out much longer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the Emperor! Stand your ground! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I can't do it anymore...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone who turns tail will be executed on the spot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay put! We must not expose ourselves yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ursus guards... are getting overwhelmed by Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... What they're broadcasting on television can't be farther from the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even in this situation, the Chernobog authorities are still playing their games.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "But things are getting worse for us too. We can't expect to sneak out anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Terrible road conditions and enemy blockades... We won't be able to use our own vehicles anymore...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. The rescue team must be large enough to clear out any Reunion members that block our way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Splitting up any further would be suicide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "These Ursus guards...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "They might look powerful because they're well-equipped, but Reunion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion clearly has an overwhelming advantage in numbers and morale!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is nothing like when we first investigated Chernobog...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we sneaked in, the quantity, distribution, and status of Chernobog's guards and military were in a very bizarre state.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then, we just couldn't figure out why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Had Reunion already destroyed most of Chernobog's defenses at that point?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though I don't have any proof, if Reunion has grown powerful enough to launch such a large-scale operation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "... All I can say is that I feel lucky those guards are being surrounded, instead of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, we must be vigilant of our surroundings. By the time we end up in a crisis, it'll already be too late--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Doctor, hurry and gather your teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our scouts have discovered Reunion forces. They're about to come in contact with our rescue team!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "For now, being cautious is the only advantage we can get.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
